<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan stock market closes for public holiday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan stock market closes for public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Taiwan stock market is closed on Tuesday for the beginning of a seven-day lunar new year holiday.</p>
<p>On Monday, the weighted index closed 31.49 points or 0.43 percent higher at 7,346.88.</p>
<p>Turnover was a hectic T$77.72 billion.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on February 11.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
